  "question": {
    "text": "The domain of the definition of the function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
